OL,3,GNEWSALetter written on RMS Mauretania
OL,4,Aamong auction lots
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn archive of letters including from
OL,7,Fpolar explorers, Winston Churchill and
OL,8,FFlorence Nightingale is up for auction.
OL,10,FThe letters, from some of the most
OL,11,Fcelebrated figures of the late 19th and
OL,12,Fearly 20th Centuries, were assembled
OL,13,Ffor decades by siblings Gerald Christy,
OL,14,FRobert Miller Christy and Eva Christy.
OL,16,FThey will be auctioned at Young's in
OL,17,FFarnham, Surrey, on Thursday, and also
OL,18,Finclude correspondence from Sir Arthur
OL,19,FConan Doyle and a letter written on
OL,20,Fboard the RMS Mauretania on 17 April
OL,21,F1912, just days after the sinking of
OL,22,Fthe Titanic.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
